<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρι-γένεια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a third generation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τ. παραμένειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐκ τριγενείας στιγματίαι</span>
			v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.446
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριγονία.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>threefold gender</i> (implied in one form), <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				212.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ διὰ μιᾶς φωνῆς τριγένειαν
					ὑπαγορεύοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Adv.</u>
					141.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀγαθῶν</span>
			<i>three kinds</i> of goods, <u>Stoic.</u>ap.<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.181
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
